subsection.subsection:
On or before April 30 of each year, an owner of real property subject to a low-income housing covenant shall provide to the county assessor the following on a form approved by the commission:
a signed statement from the property owner that the project continues to meet the requirements of the low-income housing covenant;
a certified financial operating statement for the property for the prior year;
rent rolls for the property for the prior year;
federal and commercial financing terms and agreements for the property; and
for a property under construction, actual construction costs incurred as of the lien date.
